  (text "SCHEMATIC PASS 1 - SENSOR MEASUREMENT AND HARDWARE RANGE GATES"
    (at 25.4 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ea70d836-5bbd-4c46-ae44-76bf5abb3458")
  )
  (text "Thermistor front end follows preliminary design intent: protected divider, 10 k 0.1 percent pull-up target, ADC filter, and independent hardware window comparator.\nFinal curve, thresholds, resistor values, pull-up rail, and fault thresholds require field verification against the installed sensor."
    (at 25.4 35.56 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "7168910d-f784-44ed-8907-0d56815bb240")
  )
  (text "SFS front end is intentionally abstract: SFS electrical type/range is TBD. Use high-impedance excitation or buffer only after measuring the installed harness.\nSFS_RANGE_OK must drop on open, short, overtemperature/fault, or out-of-window behavior without firmware help."
    (at 25.4 63.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "d067c7a2-a518-455e-b979-bfe3b21c63af")
  )
  (text "ADS1115 allocation:\nAIN0 = water thermistor divider\nAIN1 = stack flue sensor measurement\nAIN2 = VRAW/rail monitor review stub\nAIN3 = spare/review stub\nI2C pullups and address strap values remain TBD."
    (at 25.4 93.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "34321334-b29d-44f5-9cb0-bd24a38020f1")
  )
